{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The single storey rear extension, by reason of its inappropriate size, scale and positioning, results in overshadowing, an increased sense of enclosure and loss of outlook to neighbouring properties. The development therefore harms neighbours' living conditions and would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
